<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ M-3 money supply rose 0.1 pct in September.</title>
<headline>NZ M-3 money supply rose 0.1 pct in September.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank on Wednesday released the following estimated money supply figures for September:</p>
<p>    M3		   Sept 1996	Aug 1996	  Sept 1995</p>
<p>    mthly change	0.1 pct	  1.4 pct	   1.8 pct</p>
<p>    yr-on-yr change  13.8 pct	 15.8 pct	  10.2 pct</p>
</text>
